<Project xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/developer/msbuild/2003">
  <!--
    The wcpdf_worker executable ships in the WordCraftPdf.NativeAssets.{Platform} packages, under
    runtimes/<rid>/native/. NuGet copies it to the output (runtimes/<rid>/native/ for portable
    apps, the application directory for RID-specific builds), and each platform package's
    .targets restores the execute bit that NuGet drops on Unix.

    Install the package for your target platform:
      dotnet add package WordCraftPdf.NativeAssets.Linux
      dotnet add package WordCraftPdf.NativeAssets.macOS
      dotnet add package WordCraftPdf.NativeAssets.Windows

    Or point PdfConverterOptions.WorkerPath / the WCPDF_WORKER_PATH environment variable at a
    wcpdf_worker you built yourself.
  -->
</Project>
